DouZero Android Assistant

This product includes software developed by the DouZero project
(https://github.com/kwai/DouZero), licensed under Apache License 2.0.

The Android Kotlin rule engine, observation encoder, ONNX model adapter,
OpenCV template recognizer, mobile templates, anonymized regression screenshots,
and related parity tests are adapted from
Superbaaaaber/Auto-doudizhu-on-Android-based-on-Douzero
(https://github.com/Superbaaaaber/Auto-doudizhu-on-Android-based-on-Douzero),
licensed under Apache License 2.0. Package names and product boundaries were
changed; automatic clicking and accessibility automation are intentionally
excluded from this derivative work.

Other repositories without an explicit license and the user-supplied
proprietary APK were used only as behavioral references. Their source code,
model weights, artwork, server protocol, and endpoints are not included.
